  {
   "type": "markdown",
   "source": "# Annotated Sine Wave\nA sine curve on arrowed axes with amplitude and period markers — the `<polyline>` points are computed in Python, then frozen into static SVG."
  },
  {
   "type": "svg",
   "source": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" viewBox=\"0 0 500 300\" width=\"500\" height=\"300\">\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"500\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fbfdff\"/>\n  <!-- axes -->\n  <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#2e3440\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"150.0\" x2=\"470\" y2=\"150.0\" stroke=\"#2e3440\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <polygon points=\"470,150.0 460,145.0 460,155.0\" fill=\"#2e3440\"/>\n  <polygon points=\"60,20 55,30 65,30\" fill=\"#2e3440\"/>\n  <text x=\"460\" y=\"170.0\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#52606d\">t</text>\n  <text x=\"42\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#52606d\">y</text>\n  <!-- the wave -->\n  <polyline points=\"60.0,150.0 64.0,140.0 68.0,130.1 72.0,120.6 76.0,111.5 80.0,103.0 84.0,95.2 88.0,88.4 92.0,82.5 96.0,77.6 100.0,73.9 104.0,71.4 108.0,70.2 112.0,70.2 116.0,71.4 120.0,73.9 124.0,77.6 128.0,82.5 132.0,88.4 136.0,95.2 140.0,103.0 144.0,111.5 148.0,120.6 152.0,130.1 156.0,140.0 160.0,150.0 164.0,160.0 168.0,169.9 172.0,179.4 176.0,188.5 180.0,197.0 184.0,204.8 188.0,211.6 192.0,217.5 196.0,222.4 200.0,226.1 204.0,228.6 208.0,229.8 212.0,229.8 216.0,228.6 220.0,226.1 224.0,222.4 228.0,217.5 232.0,211.6 236.0,204.8 240.0,197.0 244.0,188.5 248.0,179.4 252.0,169.9 256.0,160.0 260.0,150.0 264.0,140.0 268.0,130.1 272.0,120.6 276.0,111.5 280.0,103.0 284.0,95.2 288.0,88.4 292.0,82.5 296.0,77.6 300.0,73.9 304.0,71.4 308.0,70.2 312.0,70.2 316.0,71.4 320.0,73.9 324.0,77.6 328.0,82.5 332.0,88.4 336.0,95.2 340.0,103.0 344.0,111.5 348.0,120.6 352.0,130.1 356.0,140.0 360.0,150.0 364.0,160.0 368.0,169.9 372.0,179.4 376.0,188.5 380.0,197.0 384.0,204.8 388.0,211.6 392.0,217.5 396.0,222.4 400.0,226.1 404.0,228.6 408.0,229.8 412.0,229.8 416.0,228.6 420.0,226.1 424.0,222.4 428.0,217.5 432.0,211.6 436.0,204.8 440.0,197.0 444.0,188.5 448.0,179.4 452.0,169.9 456.0,160.0 460.0,150.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3776ab\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n  <!-- amplitude marker -->\n  <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"150.0\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"70.0\" stroke=\"#e07b39\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/>\n  <text x=\"116\" y=\"110.0\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#e07b39\">A</text>\n  <!-- period marker -->\n  <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"248.0\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"248.0\" stroke=\"#e07b39\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"242.0\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"254.0\" stroke=\"#e07b39\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"260\" y1=\"242.0\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"254.0\" stroke=\"#e07b39\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"160.0\" y=\"266.0\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#e07b39\" text-anchor=\"middle\">period T</text>\n  <text x=\"250.0\" y=\"24\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2e3440\" text-anchor=\"middle\">y = A sin(2&#960;t / T)</text>\n</svg>"
  }
 ]
